     --font-mono: var(--font-jetbrains-mono), ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
     --font-wordmark: 'ravenicons', var(--font-display);
   }

   html {
     background-color: var(--color-bg);
     color: var(--color-body);
   }

   body {
     font-family: var(--font-sans);
   }

   h1, h2, h3, h4 {
     font-family: var(--font-display);
     color: var(--color-ink);
   }

   .raven-wordmark {
     font-family: var(--font-wordmark);
     letter-spacing: 0.05em;
   }
   ```

3. Replace `landing/src/app/layout.tsx` to:
   - Import `Inter`, `Space_Grotesk`, and `JetBrains_Mono` from `next/font/google` (NOT `Lexend`).
   - Each font: `subsets: ['latin']`, `display: 'swap'`, `variable` set to `--font-inter`, `--font-space-grotesk`, `--font-jetbrains-mono` respectively.
   - `metadata` object: `title.template === '%s — Raven'`, `title.default === 'Raven — Self-hostable AI knowledge platform for teams'`, `description` is the Raven sentence (mentions "self-hostable", "multi-tenant", "voice", "chat", "edge"), `metadataBase: new URL('https://raven.ravencloak.org')`.
