   - `<body className="flex min-h-full flex-col">{children}</body>`.
   - Imports `'@/styles/tailwind.css'`.

4. **Out of scope** for T2 — must NOT have happened:
   - Modifications to `landing/src/app/page.tsx`, `landing/src/components/*`, or anything outside the three files above.
   - Adding Header/Footer to the root layout (those are added per page in T4+).
   - Adding a `<head>` element manually (Next 15+ App Router handles `<head>` from `metadata`).
   - Pushing or opening a PR.
   - Adding any other font besides Inter / Space Grotesk / JetBrains Mono / ravenicons.

5. Single commit on `feat/landing-salient-rebuild` with title `feat(landing): wire Raven brand palette, fonts, and ravenicons`. No `Co-Authored-By` trailer.

